  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together apple cider vinegar, olive oil, garlic, salt, black pepper, and paprika",
    "Add the pork pieces to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade",
    "Thread the marinated pork pieces onto skewers",
    "Grill the skewers for 10-12 minutes, turning occasionally",
    "Let the skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving",
    "Serve hot and enjoy",
    "Cook pork to an internal temperature of 63°C / 145°F and let it rest for 3 minutes before serving."
